    "notes": "All 12 views inspected. Katana with a correctly curved single-edge blade, a round brass tsuba, a pale cord-wrapped tsuka with a visible diamond wrap pattern and a brass kashira cap. The curvature is consistent in the top and side views and the wrap pattern continues around the grip. Materials score 4 because the hamon and steel are represented by flat colour rather than a layered shader. Free-standing weapon, unrigged.",
